{"ID":"20240118145009-4h1p1sd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145009-4h1p1sd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145009-4h1p1sd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145009-4us94ka\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162900-mraybxd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162900-mraybxd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:272,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:272\u0026#125;","title":"341斑蟊（斑猫）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204151122"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145009-4us94ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145009-4us94ka","updated":"20240122162826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛寒，有毒。治寒热，鬼疰，虫毒，鼠瘘，恶疮，疽蚀，死肌，破石癃。生川谷。一名龙尾。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162835-q8ixmty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162835-q8ixmty"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，大豆叶上甲虫也，有黄斑文。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162837-fsdfxie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162837-fsdfxie"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162838-ebaneje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162838-ebaneje"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】斑蟊主瘰疬虫毒，治血积，蚀死肌，破石癃，堕妊娠死胎，敷鼠瘘恶疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162840-dnotgc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162840-dnotgc5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】血积，伤人肌，治疥癣，堕胎。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162841-32ttq0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162841-32ttq0v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治瘰疬，通利水道。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162842-homm041","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162842-homm041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】疗淋疾，傅恶疮，瘘烂。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162843-qwryfpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162843-qwryfpr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二分至三分。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162845-j96ymt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162845-j96ymt2","updated":"20240122162850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】有毒，用时去翅足，同糯米炒熟，或麸炒过，醋煮用，亦有用米取气不取质者，生用则吐泻，马刀为使，畏巴豆丹参空青，恶曾青甘草豆花，惟性猛毒，力能烂肉堕胎，体虚者忌之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162847-0az2lov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162847-0az2lov"}},{"ID":"20240122162847-nb1dbul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162847-nb1dbul"}},{"ID":"20240122162854-gy49cgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162854-gy49cgi","updated":"20240204151005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢341，这个药叫斑蝥，斑蝥长的就跟甲虫一样，这么大一个。斑蝥在治疗女人的子宫肌瘤、子宫肿瘤，动物性的药很强。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162900-mraybxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162900-mraybxd","updated":"20240204151122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上，你如果用斑蝥，斑蝥很毒，把那个翅膀、脚、头统统去掉，烤干以后打成粉，放一点点剂量下去，一般来说女人吃了比较不舒服，是可以攻坚——子宫的肿瘤，可是妇女吃完就一天，那阴道那边就很想上厕所的感觉，一直想排东西出来，排不出来，就没办法出去上班，因为她一直上完厕所就想去小便，小完便才出来又急着回厕所。斑蝥比较毒。那一般来说我们攻坚来使用，攻那个子宫肿瘤的时候，动物性的药是一个考量的地方，诸位看这个斑蝥，味辛，性寒，有毒，主瘰疬虫毒血积，都可以下死胎的，那也可以堕胎，诸位看这个禁忌的方式，如何使用斑蝥，现在药房你可以买的到斑蝥，使用的不多，一般来说中医不会去使用它，因为太强了，吃下去很不舒服。"}]}]}